  "steps": [
    "Melt the chocolate in a bowl with 1 tsp oil (microwave or double boiler) until smooth and glossy.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the protein powder, pumpkin seeds, sunflower seeds, and pomegranate.",
    "Pour the melted chocolate over the mixture and gently fold everything together so everything gets lightly coated.",
    "On a plate lined with parchment, drop small spoonfuls of the mixture to form mini clusters. Make around 14 for 70 cals per cluster or 9-10 for 110 cals each.",
    "Top with sesame seeds for crunch (optional but fab). Let them set in the freezer for 20–25 minutes until firm."
